g check-raised, and see the next card for free to realize your equity.\n\nReason: You have a marginal made hand with a bad kicker in a spot where the opponent could easily have a higher pair (Aces) or a strong draw. Keeping the pot small is the best strategy for a hand of this strength.\n\nAnswer: 0"}
