ht be called by a pair of 9s or a King.\n\nReason: I have a marginal hand with showdown value (Ace-high) and a draw. Checking minimizes risk and allows me to realize my equity for free. Betting might force out worse hands that I beat, while getting called by better hands.\n\nAnswer: 0'}
